tival. Since completing the demo, development on the full game has continued at full speed. Recent Progress • Major visual upgrades throughout the game • Rebuilt fighter sp","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T10:35:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776365","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4999100-1840310314338846","game_id":"steam-4999100","kind":"update","title":"MegaBlast Mayhem Major Update – Steam Release Date!","summary":"Steam Release Approved! We're excited to share that Eucalyptus Edge: MegaBlast Mayhem has officially been approved by Steam for release! After years of development that began as a university project in 2021, MegaBlast Mayhem has grown into PhoenixGold Game Studios' first commercial release and the first game set in the world of Verdantia. The finish line is finally in sight! What's New • Complete visual overhaul across menus and gameplay • Beautiful handcrafted arenas spanning five unique Verdan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T10:44:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314338846","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4999100-1839676055881945","game_id":"steam-4999100","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to the MegaBlast Festival!","summary":"Welcome to the MegaBlast Festival! Welcome to the official Steam Community Hub for Eucalyptus Edge: MegaBlast Mayhem! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46234538/d5a0975d6dad58f49d4d65aaf6b40aa0f43a9534.png Today marks an exciting milestone for PhoenixGold Game Studios as our first commercial game officially arrives on Steam as an upcoming release. What is MegaBlast Mayhem? {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46234538/ac6518d55b8f